重要了，至少要知道什么人不能惹。 拍得很二次元，基努里维斯大叔帅到没边，拳拳到肉的感觉看着很过瘾。 被影评骗了 我觉得动作并不是很出彩 看得出来很多动作像是自己完成的 所以才觉得看上去有点笨笨呆呆慢慢的... 算比较紧凑的复仇片 但没有什么记忆深刻的地方 看完觉得wick这个人物也不过是主角光环~ 基努里维斯终于帅回来了。'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'John Wick is the main character in the "John Wick" film series, portrayed by Keanu Reeves. He is a highly skilled and efficient hitman who, after the death of his beloved dog, embarks on a path of revenge against those who wronged him. The character is known for his precision, focus, and determination in completing tasks, earning him the nickname "Baba Yaga" or "The Boogeyman" in the criminal underworld. The films showcase his journey through the world of assassins and his quest for vengeance, making him a legendary figure in the series.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'that 32k in model type, what does it mean'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:5', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:5', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': "Learn the differences between GPT-4 model versions. There are a few different GPT-4 models to choose from, including a new generation of GPT-4 models. There are a few main things to consider (not an exhaustive list) when choosing which GPT-4 model to use: You can check out our models page for more details on each GPT-4 model and their features.\n定义： “context length”指的是模型在进行一次特定的推理时可以考虑的最大令牌数。 换句话说，它是模型在生成响应之前可以“回顾”和“理解”的输入内容的长度。 作用：这个参数决定了模型能够记住和参考多少先前的信息。 较长的上下文长度允许模型在生成响应时利用更多的历史信息。 两者的区别: 功能差异：Max tokens影响输出的长度，而context length影响模型在生成这些输出时可以利用的输入信息的长度。 应用场景：在一个长对话或文档中，context length决定了模型能够考虑到多少历史信息，而max tokens则决定了模型一次能生成多长的回应。\nSee model versions to learn about how Azure OpenAI Service handles model version upgrades, and working with models to learn how to view and configure the model version settings of your GPT-3.5 Turbo deployments.\nGPT-4-32k is a variant of the GPT-4 model, designed to handle a larger context window of up to 32,768 tokens. This capability allows it to process and generate more extensive text inputs and outputs, making it particularly useful for applications requiring in-depth analysis or long-form content generation.\nGPT-4 是一个大型多模态模型（今天接受文本输入和发出文本输出，将来会出现图像输入），由于其更广泛的一般知识和高级推理能力，它可以比我们以前的任何模型更准确地解决难题。 与 gpt-3.5-turbo 一样，GPT-4 针对聊天进行了优化，但也适用于传统的补全（Completion）任务。 在我们的 会话补全（Completion）指南 中了解如何使用 GPT-4。 GPT-4 目前处于 Limited beta 阶段，只有获得访问权限的人才能访问。 请 加入候补名单，以便在容量可用时获得访问权限。 比任何 GPT-3.5 模型都更强大，能够执行更复杂的任务，并针对聊天进行了优化。 将使用我们最新的模型迭代进行更新。 2023 gpt-4 年 6 月 13 日的快照，包含函数调用数据。\nGPT‑4 is a large multimodal model (accepting image and text inputs, emitting text outputs) that, while less capable than humans in many real-world scenarios, exhibits human-level performance on various professional and academic benchmarks.\nThe token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model’s context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096). To answer your question, as of now it seems that the only way to get the 8k token version is by your own API request. Thank you for this question.\nChatGPT 32K: The Heavyweight Contender. The ChatGPT 32K model, on the other hand, is designed to process larger contexts – think paragraphs or even entire articles. This behemoth of a model is ideal for tasks that require deeper understanding and analysis, such as: Text classification; Sentiment analysis (long-form texts) Document summarization\nGPT-4 32K 0613 is OpenAI's large language model with a 32,768 token context window, released in June 2023. This advanced AI system allows for processing longer texts while maintaining context and generating high-quality responses across various applications, from content creation to technical documentation.\nThe 32k tag refers to AI models that have been trained on or operate with 32,000 parameters or more. This tag is significant as it indicates a model's capacity for complex processing, large-scale data handling, and potentially improved performance on tasks such as natural language processing, image recognition, and predictive analytics."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The "32k" in model type refers to AI models that have been trained on or operate with 32,000 parameters or more. This tag is significant as it indicates a model\'s capacity for complex processing, large-scale data handling, and potentially improved performance on tasks such as natural language processing, image recognition, and predictive analytics. Specifically, for models like GPT-4-32k, it means the model can handle a larger context window of up to 32,768 tokens, allowing it to process and generate more extensive text inputs and outputs. This capability is particularly useful for applications requiring in-depth analysis or long-form content generation.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 14, 2025. The weather in Beijing is clear with a temperature of 7°C (45°F), a humidity of 36%, and a wind speed of 9 km/h (6 mph) coming from the southeast. The visibility is 10 km (6 miles), and the UV index is 0.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 14, 2025. The weather in Beijing is clear with a temperature of 7°C (45°F), a humidity of 36%, and a wind speed of 9 km/h (6 mph) coming from the southeast. The visibility is 10 km (6 miles), and the UV index is 0.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'who is John Wick'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:2', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:2', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': '《疾速追杀》（John Wick）是由狮门影业出品，大卫·雷奇、查德·斯塔尔斯基联袂执导，德里克·科尔斯塔编剧，基努·里维斯、迈克尔·恩奎斯特、阿尔菲·艾伦、威廉·达福主演的101分钟动作惊悚片，于2014年10月24日在美国上映。\n约翰·威克（John Wick）是《疾速追杀》系列电影及衍生作品系列中的主要角色，初次登场于《疾速追杀》（John Wick）系列电影第一部（2014年10月），由基努·里维斯饰演。\n电影里John Wick的世界是一个被杀手组织笼罩的世界，但是杀手们大多纪律严明，被注册和监管。杀手互相是有耳闻的，John Wick一直能完成别人完不成的任务，别人不敢接的任务，他都能完成，所以名声在外。记得其中一个杀手说“Mr Wick，能和你交手我们很\n今天二刷了John Wick 4，这个时代当之无愧的gun porn顶流，第4部更是在场面和摄影更上一层楼，片头的大阪洲际酒店内冷热兵器的交锋，柏林夜店里飞舞的战斧，凯旋门车流中的枪战，房屋里Gen12霰弹枪配上龙息弹，在《迈阿密热线》俯视视角下一镜到底的\n该片讲述了大难不死的 约翰·威克 （基努·里维斯 饰）为了获得期盼已久的安宁与自由，越洋前往大阪大陆酒店，向经理兼老朋友岛津浩二（真田广之 饰）求助。 另一方面，高桌会的新领导人文森特·德·格拉蒙特侯爵（比尔·斯卡斯加德 饰）决心斩草除根，他先对付纽约大陆酒店经理 温斯顿 （伊恩·麦柯肖恩 饰），再逼使威克昔日战友该隐（甄子丹 饰）替他效力，誓要孤立约翰·威克的同时，不断提高对 约翰·威克 的赏金 [19]。 巨额赏金的诱惑下，吸引来了潜在的赏金猎人对威克的追杀。 被逐出高桌会的威克在与高桌会的对抗过程中找到了击败高桌会的方法，最终在朋友的帮助下，开始了自己的反击 [20]。\n他在《杀神John Wick 4 》中的表现被外媒盛赞：“甄子丹的加入让系列动作戏提升到新高度！”网友笑称：“丹哥这是要凭盲侠角色横扫好莱坞了 ...\n主人公:约翰·威克（John Wick），出生于白俄罗斯，受训于俄罗斯罗姆杀手组织（the Ruska Roma），后服务于一个俄罗斯黑帮，第一部开始遇到真爱退隐江湖。在电影里杀手世界的地位相当于《多情剑客无情剑》里的李寻欢，“小李飞刀，例不虚发。\nJohn Wick: Directed by Chad Stahelski. With Keanu Reeves, Michael Nyqvist, Alfie Allen, Willem Dafoe. John Wick is a former hitman grieving the loss of his true love. When his home is broken into, robbed, and his dog killed, he is forced to return to action to exact revenge.\n乔纳森·威克，简称约翰·威克，出生名贾达尼·乔沃诺维奇（Джарданы Джовонович），是《疾速追杀》系列电影的主角。 在自己漫长而血腥的江湖生涯中，约翰·威克成为了全世界最高效、最老练的职业杀手，赢得了广泛的声誉。 他辉煌的战绩、令人敬畏的专业技能、从不失手的精准、毫不动摇的专注和不完成任务誓不罢休的决心都让他立于不败之地，也让他在国际地下犯罪世界中的传奇地位牢不可催。 他也赢得了 Baba Yaga 或 The Boogeyman 的赫赫威名，令许多人闻风丧胆、又敬又怕。 他之前一直在为纽约的俄罗斯黑帮塔拉索夫帮效力。 为了陪伴自己的妻子海伦·威克，他决定退休。\n偷车的混混（阿尔菲·艾伦 Alfie Allen 饰）是黑帮大佬维格•塔拉索夫（迈克尔·恩奎斯特 Michael Nyqvist 饰）的儿子，而维格在听说这件事后显得紧张非常，因为约翰有着令人胆战心惊的身份。 他曾是名震江湖的冷血杀手，当年替塔拉索夫杀掉不少难缠的对手，后来却为了妻子金盆洗手。 好看！ 全程无尿点。 熊孩子坑爹的故事，这部电影告诉我们——子女教育太重要了，至少要知道什么人不能惹。 拍得很二次元，基努里维斯大叔帅到没边，拳拳到肉的感觉看着很过瘾。 被影评骗了 我觉得动作并不是很出彩 看得出来很多动作像是自己完成的 所以才觉得看上去有点笨笨呆呆慢慢的... 算比较紧凑的复仇片 但没有什么记忆深刻的地方 看完觉得wick这个人物也不过是主角光环~ 基努里维斯终于帅回来了。'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'John Wick is the main character in the "John Wick" film series, portrayed by Keanu Reeves. He is a highly skilled and efficient hitman who, after the death of his beloved dog, embarks on a path of revenge against those who wronged him. The character is known for his precision, focus, and determination in completing tasks, earning him the nickname "Baba Yaga" or "The Boogeyman" in the criminal underworld. The films showcase his journey through the world of assassins and his quest for vengeance, making him a legendary figure in the series.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 14, 2025. The weather in Beijing is clear with a temperature of 7°C (45°F), a humidity of 36%, and a wind speed of 9 km/h (6 mph) coming from the southeast. The visibility is 10 km (6 miles), and the UV index is 0.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 14, 2025. The weather in Beijing is clear with a temperature of 7°C (45°F), a humidity of 36%, and a wind speed of 9 km/h (6 mph) coming from the southeast. The visibility is 10 km (6 miles), and the UV index is 0.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'who is John Wick'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:2', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:2', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': '《疾速追杀》（John Wick）是由狮门影业出品，大卫·雷奇、查德·斯塔尔斯基联袂执导，德里克·科尔斯塔编剧，基努·里维斯、迈克尔·恩奎斯特、阿尔菲·艾伦、威廉·达福主演的101分钟动作惊悚片，于2014年10月24日在美国上映。\n约翰·威克（John Wick）是《疾速追杀》系列电影及衍生作品系列中的主要角色，初次登场于《疾速追杀》（John Wick）系列电影第一部（2014年10月），由基努·里维斯饰演。\n电影里John Wick的世界是一个被杀手组织笼罩的世界，但是杀手们大多纪律严明，被注册和监管。杀手互相是有耳闻的，John Wick一直能完成别人完不成的任务，别人不敢接的任务，他都能完成，所以名声在外。记得其中一个杀手说“Mr Wick，能和你交手我们很\n今天二刷了John Wick 4，这个时代当之无愧的gun porn顶流，第4部更是在场面和摄影更上一层楼，片头的大阪洲际酒店内冷热兵器的交锋，柏林夜店里飞舞的战斧，凯旋门车流中的枪战，房屋里Gen12霰弹枪配上龙息弹，在《迈阿密热线》俯视视角下一镜到底的\n该片讲述了大难不死的 约翰·威克 （基努·里维斯 饰）为了获得期盼已久的安宁与自由，越洋前往大阪大陆酒店，向经理兼老朋友岛津浩二（真田广之 饰）求助。 另一方面，高桌会的新领导人文森特·德·格拉蒙特侯爵（比尔·斯卡斯加德 饰）决心斩草除根，他先对付纽约大陆酒店经理 温斯顿 （伊恩·麦柯肖恩 饰），再逼使威克昔日战友该隐（甄子丹 饰）替他效力，誓要孤立约翰·威克的同时，不断提高对 约翰·威克 的赏金 [19]。 巨额赏金的诱惑下，吸引来了潜在的赏金猎人对威克的追杀。 被逐出高桌会的威克在与高桌会的对抗过程中找到了击败高桌会的方法，最终在朋友的帮助下，开始了自己的反击 [20]。\n他在《杀神John Wick 4 》中的表现被外媒盛赞：“甄子丹的加入让系列动作戏提升到新高度！”网友笑称：“丹哥这是要凭盲侠角色横扫好莱坞了 ...\n主人公:约翰·威克（John Wick），出生于白俄罗斯，受训于俄罗斯罗姆杀手组织（the Ruska Roma），后服务于一个俄罗斯黑帮，第一部开始遇到真爱退隐江湖。在电影里杀手世界的地位相当于《多情剑客无情剑》里的李寻欢，“小李飞刀，例不虚发。\nJohn Wick: Directed by Chad Stahelski. With Keanu Reeves, Michael Nyqvist, Alfie Allen, Willem Dafoe. John Wick is a former hitman grieving the loss of his true love. When his home is broken into, robbed, and his dog killed, he is forced to return to action to exact revenge.\n乔纳森·威克，简称约翰·威克，出生名贾达尼·乔沃诺维奇（Джарданы Джовонович），是《疾速追杀》系列电影的主角。 在自己漫长而血腥的江湖生涯中，约翰·威克成为了全世界最高效、最老练的职业杀手，赢得了广泛的声誉。 他辉煌的战绩、令人敬畏的专业技能、从不失手的精准、毫不动摇的专注和不完成任务誓不罢休的决心都让他立于不败之地，也让他在国际地下犯罪世界中的传奇地位牢不可催。 他也赢得了 Baba Yaga 或 The Boogeyman 的赫赫威名，令许多人闻风丧胆、又敬又怕。 他之前一直在为纽约的俄罗斯黑帮塔拉索夫帮效力。 为了陪伴自己的妻子海伦·威克，他决定退休。\n偷车的混混（阿尔菲·艾伦 Alfie Allen 饰）是黑帮大佬维格•塔拉索夫（迈克尔·恩奎斯特 Michael Nyqvist 饰）的儿子，而维格在听说这件事后显得紧张非常，因为约翰有着令人胆战心惊的身份。 他曾是名震江湖的冷血杀手，当年替塔拉索夫杀掉不少难缠的对手，后来却为了妻子金盆洗手。 好看！ 全程无尿点。 熊孩子坑爹的故事，这部电影告诉我们——子女教育太重要了，至少要知道什么人不能惹。 拍得很二次元，基努里维斯大叔帅到没边，拳拳到肉的感觉看着很过瘾。 被影评骗了 我觉得动作并不是很出彩 看得出来很多动作像是自己完成的 所以才觉得看上去有点笨笨呆呆慢慢的... 算比较紧凑的复仇片 但没有什么记忆深刻的地方 看完觉得wick这个人物也不过是主角光环~ 基努里维斯终于帅回来了。'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'John Wick is the main character in the "John Wick" film series, portrayed by Keanu Reeves. He is a highly skilled and efficient hitman who, after the death of his beloved dog, embarks on a path of revenge against those who wronged him. The character is known for his precision, focus, and determination in completing tasks, earning him the nickname "Baba Yaga" or "The Boogeyman" in the criminal underworld. The films showcase his journey through the world of assassins and his quest for vengeance, making him a legendary figure in the series.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'that 32k in model type, what does it mean'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:5', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:5', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': "Learn the differences between GPT-4 model versions. There are a few different GPT-4 models to choose from, including a new generation of GPT-4 models. There are a few main things to consider (not an exhaustive list) when choosing which GPT-4 model to use: You can check out our models page for more details on each GPT-4 model and their features.\n定义： “context length”指的是模型在进行一次特定的推理时可以考虑的最大令牌数。 换句话说，它是模型在生成响应之前可以“回顾”和“理解”的输入内容的长度。 作用：这个参数决定了模型能够记住和参考多少先前的信息。 较长的上下文长度允许模型在生成响应时利用更多的历史信息。 两者的区别: 功能差异：Max tokens影响输出的长度，而context length影响模型在生成这些输出时可以利用的输入信息的长度。 应用场景：在一个长对话或文档中，context length决定了模型能够考虑到多少历史信息，而max tokens则决定了模型一次能生成多长的回应。\nSee model versions to learn about how Azure OpenAI Service handles model version upgrades, and working with models to learn how to view and configure the model version settings of your GPT-3.5 Turbo deployments.\nGPT-4-32k is a variant of the GPT-4 model, designed to handle a larger context window of up to 32,768 tokens. This capability allows it to process and generate more extensive text inputs and outputs, making it particularly useful for applications requiring in-depth analysis or long-form content generation.\nGPT-4 是一个大型多模态模型（今天接受文本输入和发出文本输出，将来会出现图像输入），由于其更广泛的一般知识和高级推理能力，它可以比我们以前的任何模型更准确地解决难题。 与 gpt-3.5-turbo 一样，GPT-4 针对聊天进行了优化，但也适用于传统的补全（Completion）任务。 在我们的 会话补全（Completion）指南 中了解如何使用 GPT-4。 GPT-4 目前处于 Limited beta 阶段，只有获得访问权限的人才能访问。 请 加入候补名单，以便在容量可用时获得访问权限。 比任何 GPT-3.5 模型都更强大，能够执行更复杂的任务，并针对聊天进行了优化。 将使用我们最新的模型迭代进行更新。 2023 gpt-4 年 6 月 13 日的快照，包含函数调用数据。\nGPT‑4 is a large multimodal model (accepting image and text inputs, emitting text outputs) that, while less capable than humans in many real-world scenarios, exhibits human-level performance on various professional and academic benchmarks.\nThe token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model’s context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096). To answer your question, as of now it seems that the only way to get the 8k token version is by your own API request. Thank you for this question.\nChatGPT 32K: The Heavyweight Contender. The ChatGPT 32K model, on the other hand, is designed to process larger contexts – think paragraphs or even entire articles. This behemoth of a model is ideal for tasks that require deeper understanding and analysis, such as: Text classification; Sentiment analysis (long-form texts) Document summarization\nGPT-4 32K 0613 is OpenAI's large language model with a 32,768 token context window, released in June 2023. This advanced AI system allows for processing longer texts while maintaining context and generating high-quality responses across various applications, from content creation to technical documentation.\nThe 32k tag refers to AI models that have been trained on or operate with 32,000 parameters or more. This tag is significant as it indicates a model's capacity for complex processing, large-scale data handling, and potentially improved performance on tasks such as natural language processing, image recognition, and predictive analytics."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The "32k" in model type refers to AI models that have been trained on or operate with 32,000 parameters or more. This tag is significant as it indicates a model\'s capacity for complex processing, large-scale data handling, and potentially improved performance on tasks such as natural language processing, image recognition, and predictive analytics. Specifically, for models like GPT-4-32k, it means the model can handle a larger context window of up to 32,768 tokens, allowing it to process and generate more extensive text inputs and outputs. This capability is particularly useful for applications requiring in-depth analysis or long-form content generation.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'how many KB that 32,768 tokens is '}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:11', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:11', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': '配置：设置 max_tokens=63,000（需满足 1K + 63K ≤ 64K）。风险：输出可能因内容质量检测（如重复性、敏感词）被提前终止。长输入 + 短输出 场景：输入 60K tokens 的文档，要求生成摘要。配置：设置 max_tokens=4,000（60K + 4K ≤ 64K）。\n要决定“max tokens”和“context length”的合理设置，需要考虑几个关键因素： 任务类型：不同的任务可能需要不同的设置。 例如，生成长文章可能需要更高的max tokens值，而对话式任务可能更依赖于较长的context length以保持对话的连贯性。\n例如，GPT-4的context length可以达到8,192 tokens，而某些特定版本如GPT-4-32k甚至可以达到32,768 tokens。 特别注意 context length限制了模型在生成时可以考虑的上下文信息的总量， 这个限制包括了输入和输出的总和 ，而不是单独限制生成的内容长度。\n因为你运行命令中是设置为： --max-model-len 32768，你超过这个长度肯定报错，你不设置，默认应该是128k ，但是推理服务不一定能加载启动得了，看你显存大小。 在显存还算够用能加载启动得情况下，增加这个值，看看. 我是想让一次对话处理超过33000（token）的文本，然后我一开始在没有修改max_position_embeddings时，也报错了，在config.json中加了rope_scaling相关的配置也报错，后来我只是将max_position_embeddings从32768增加至64768，然后再处理这个33000 (token)长的文本时，就可以正常处理了。\n在生成配置中，我们可以设置max_output_tokens。 这个参数决定了响应中可以生成的最大Token数。 在Gemini中，一个Token大约相当于4个字符，而100个Token大约对应62-80个单词。 如果你想得到更短的响应，可以将max_output_tokens设置为较低的值，比如1。 相反，如果你希望得到更长的回答，可以把它设置为较高的值，比如2000。 让我们把max_output_tokens设置为10，看看它如何影响输出。 调用API后，我们得到了一个非常简短的响应："一个男人坐在电脑前。 "你会发现它并没有完整输出一句话，但这正是我们预期的结果。 根据你的具体需求，你可能会想控制输出的长度。 如果你需要非常简洁的回答，可以降低这个值。\n详见 vLLM - Qwen。并发能力 32K 上下文 1 卡：Maximum concurrency for 32768 tokens per request: 1.17x 2 卡：Maximum concurrency for 32768 tokens per request: 10.41x 4 卡：Maximum concurrency for 32768 tokens per request: 29.05x\nvllm adopts efficient management of attention key and value memory with PagedAttention, that is, the so-called KV cache. The size of the KV cache is computed online based on the model architecture and the available GPU memory. The errors means that the token sequences (32768 tokens) are too long for your GPU devices to accommodate.\nhuggingface上看Context Length: Full 32,768 tokens and generation 8192 tokens。 我本地查看时候显示的是131,072？ 搞懵了。\n(3) 第 3 轮对话： 用户新输入 5K tokens，服务端将截断最早的 5K tokens，保留最近的 59K tokens 历史记录，加上新的 5K tokens 输入，总计 64K tokens。 通过理解 Token、最大输出长度和上下文长度这三个核心概念，并根据具体的应用场景制定合理的策略，我们可以更有效地驾驭 LLM 技术，充分发挥其潜力。\n1. 背景最近要做大模型备案，涉及到文件存储和token的换算，故整理了个换算脚本。 2. 具体步骤要做文件存储大小与token数的换算，有三个数据需要获取得到，具体如下： 中英文字符占比（注意是字符占比）中英文字符…\n微调开元模型qwe1.5b和7b都支持最多32768个tokens的上下文长度。 在语言模型中，上下文长度是指模型一次能够处理并生成回应的输入文本的长度。 这个长度通常以tokens（词汇单元）的数量来衡量。\n不设置--max-model-len 32768的话，只要模型推理服务加载运行ok，显存是够的，默认得应该是128k，我本地运行--max-model-len 设置为：16384,太大就启动加载不了，显存不够。\n解决方法1：设置max-model-len或 gpu-memory-utilization. max-model-len 是设置模型支持的上下文大小，例如max-model-len=512，如果输入长度为1024，模型会报错。 我的 KV cache (1152) ，因此在启动命令最后加入： 设置max-model-len为小于等于 KV cache 即可。 vllm正常启动后的样子. 正常启动会输出访问的网址的。 解决方法2：取消使用KV cache. 该方法适合想支持长上下文的情况。 方法是修改模型配置 config.json. 例如 Qwen1.5- 14B -Chat-GPTQ-Int8 大模型 KV cache 参数是 use_cache。\n通常在 api 计费时会谈到一个词，叫做百万 Token，也就是 1M Tokens = 1,000,000 Tokens。因此： 如果是中文，每百万 Token 大约相当于 70-100 万个汉字。如果是英文，每百万 Token 大约相当于 50-75 万个单词。多轮对话中的 Token 在多轮对话的上下文\n其实默认配置应该是就可以8K的，其它参数还有max_new_tokens按需配置就可以。 Upload images, audio, and videos by dragging in the text input, pasting, or clicking here. 是只需要修改generation_config.json中的max_window_size参数吗？ 我只修改了这个参数，在使用长文本>8k时，会报警告：token indices sequence length is longer than the specified maximum sequence length for this model (12805>8192). 需要修...\ngeneration_parameters={max_new_tokens:32768,temperature:0.6,top_p:0.95}。我完整的参数是这个：MODEL_ARGS="pretrained=$model_path,dtype=bfloat16,max_model_length=32768,gpu_memory_utilization=0.8,generation_parameters={max_new_tokens:32768,temperature:0.6,top_p:0.95},data_parallel_size=$NUM_GPUS"\nChatGPT-4-32 k 模型的上下文上限是 32k Tokens，即 32000 个 token。 需要注意的是，token 限制同时对一次性输入和一次对话的总体上下文长度生效。 不是达到上限就停止对话，而是会遗忘最前面的对话。 如果想直观查看 GPT 如何切分 token，可以打开： https://platform.openai.com/tokenizer 。 此外，GPT3 和 GPT3.5/4 的 token 计算方式不同，英文的 Token 占用相对于中文较少，这也是很多中文长 Prompt 会被建议翻译成英文设定然后要求中文输出的原因。 关于 token 你应该了解…… 从官方文档可以看到我们目前使用的模型有哪些，以及每个模型的token限制。\n在使用langchain框架构建本地知识库时，query过程中报错“This model\'s maximum context length is 4097 tokens, however you requested 6391 tokens (5367 in your prompt;检查了很多问题，最后发现是TextSplitter的问题。\nContext length support up to 128K tokens and can generate up to 8K tokens. This issue has been automatically locked since there has not been any recent activity after it was closed. Please open a new issue for related bugs. Qwen2.5 is the large language model series developed by Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud. - 如何配置使支持128K上下文？\n如腾讯 1token ≈ 1.8个汉字，通义千问、千帆大模型等 1token = 1 个汉字，对于英文文本来说， 1 个 token 通常对应3至4个字母， 不同的模型对相同的输入分词， 分词结果是不一样的。 前言 通过简单回顾阿里中间件 (Aliware) 消息引擎的发展史，本文开篇于双 11 消息引擎面临的低延迟挑战，通过经典的应用场景阐述可能会面临的问题 - 响应慢，雪崩，用户体验差，继而交易下跌。 为了应对这些不可控的洪峰数据，中间件团队通过大量研究和实践，推出了低延迟高可用解决方案，在分布式 存储 领域具有一定的普适性。 在此基础上，通过对现有有限资源的规划，又推出了分级的容量保障策略，通过限流、降级，甚至... 什么是“每百万 token ”？ -来自DeepSeek的回答。'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The size of 32,768 tokens in kilobytes (KB) can vary depending on the model and the specific encoding used. However, generally speaking, 1 token is approximately 1 to 4 bytes, which means 32,768 tokens would be roughly between 32,768 bytes (32 KB) to 131,072 bytes (128 KB). For a more precise calculation, you would need to know the exact model specifications and tokenization method used.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'do you like John Wick'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:23', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:23', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': 'In what is almost a hilarious and completely original critique of the movie series, one Redditor accuses Wick of not remotely caring about the environment.\nJohn Wick has fought hard for it. This review was filed from the North American premiere at the 2023 SXSW Film Festival. “John Wick: Chapter 4” opens on March 24 th .\nJohn Wick is back - and Keanu Reeves\' ex-hitman seems to be improving with age, with his return for a fourth instalment earning the action thriller franchise its best reviews so far. Rotten...\nCritics say the latest John Wick adventure might be the best action film of the year, full of spectacular thrills, memorable supporting performances, and at least one set piece you won\'t...\nJohn Wick is a violent, violent, violent film, but its artful splatter is miles away from the brutality of "Taken" or the gleeful gore of "The Equalizer." It’s a beautiful coffee-table action movie. With Wick—the best Reeves role in years, and the best existential actioner since Drive—Reeves fans have found something that should cheer them up, too.\nFormer hitman John Wick (Keanu Reeves) comes out of retirement to track down the gangsters who took everything from him.\nLionsgate’s John Wick movies have always been over-the-top action / thriller joyrides more focused on dazzling you with visceral, expertly choreographed action sequences than trying to tell the...\nThe "John Wick" franchise exploded in a way that not even Lionsgate Studios may have foreseen. The Keanu Reeves-led action series has generated over $1 billion at the box office in the four films ...\nJohn Wick 5 is officially on the table, according to Lionsgate executive Jenefer Brown.She shared the update during an event for the John Wick Experience, a franchise-adjacent tourist attraction in Las Vegas. Her announcement comes a few months ahead of the release of Ballerina, the Ana de Armas-starrer set between the events of the third and the fourth John Wick films.\nBrown also expressed excitement about the other projects in the John Wick franchise, including the upcoming spinoff film, Ballerina. The movie\'s events occur between Chapter 3 and Chapter 4, featuring Reeves alongside lead star Ana de Armas."Up next, of course, we have Ballerina, which is our first spinoff movie and [we] can\'t wait for that [to be released] to the world," she said.'}][{'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 14, 2025. The weather in Beijing is clear with a temperature of 7°C (45°F), a humidity of 36%, and a wind speed of 9 km/h (6 mph) coming from the southeast. The visibility is 10 km (6 miles), and the UV index is 0.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 14, 2025. The weather in Beijing is clear with a temperature of 7°C (45°F), a humidity of 36%, and a wind speed of 9 km/h (6 mph) coming from the southeast. The visibility is 10 km (6 miles), and the UV index is 0.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'who is John Wick'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'web_search:2', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'web_search'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'web_search:2', 'name': 'web_search', 'content': '《疾速追杀》（John Wick）是由狮门影业出品，大卫·雷奇、查德·斯塔尔斯基联袂执导，德里克·科尔斯塔编剧，基努·里维斯、迈克尔·恩奎斯特、阿尔菲·艾伦、威廉·达福主演的101分钟动作惊悚片，于2014年10月24日在美国上映。\n约翰·威克（John Wick）是《疾速追杀》系列电影及衍生作品系列中的主要角色，初次登场于《疾速追杀》（John Wick）系列电影第一部（2014年10月），由基努·里维斯饰演。\n电影里John Wick的世界是一个被杀手组织笼罩的世界，但是杀手们大多纪律严明，被注册和监管。杀手互相是有耳闻的，John Wick一直能完成别人完不成的任务，别人不敢接的任务，他都能完成，所以名声在外。记得其中一个杀手说“Mr Wick，能和你交手我们很\n今天二刷了John Wick 4，这个时代当之无愧的gun porn顶流，第4部更是在场面和摄影更上一层楼，片头的大阪洲际酒店内冷热兵器的交锋，柏林夜店里飞舞的战斧，凯旋门车流中的枪战，房屋里Gen12霰弹枪配上龙息弹，在《迈阿密热线》俯视视角下一镜到底的\n该片讲述了大难不死的 约翰·威克 （基努·里维斯 饰）为了获得期盼已久的安宁与自由，越洋前往大阪大陆酒店，向经理兼老朋友岛津浩二（真田广之 饰）求助。 另一方面，高桌会的新领导人文森特·德·格拉蒙特侯爵（比尔·斯卡斯加德 饰）决心斩草除根，他先对付纽约大陆酒店经理 温斯顿 （伊恩·麦柯肖恩 饰），再逼使威克昔日战友该隐（甄子丹 饰）替他效力，誓要孤立约翰·威克的同时，不断提高对 约翰·威克 的赏金 [19]。 巨额赏金的诱惑下，吸引来了潜在的赏金猎人对威克的追杀。 被逐出高桌会的威克在与高桌会的对抗过程中找到了击败高桌会的方法，最终在朋友的帮助下，开始了自己的反击 [20]。\n他在《杀神John Wick 4 》中的表现被外媒盛赞：“甄子丹的加入让系列动作戏提升到新高度！”网友笑称：“丹哥这是要凭盲侠角色横扫好莱坞了 ...\n主人公:约翰·威克（John Wick），出生于白俄罗斯，受训于俄罗斯罗姆杀手组织（the Ruska Roma），后服务于一个俄罗斯黑帮，第一部开始遇到真爱退隐江湖。在电影里杀手世界的地位相当于《多情剑客无情剑》里的李寻欢，“小李飞刀，例不虚发。\nJohn Wick: Directed by Chad Stahelski. With Keanu Reeves, Michael Nyqvist, Alfie Allen, Willem Dafoe. John Wick is a former hitman grieving the loss of his true love. When his home is broken into, robbed, and his dog killed, he is forced to return to action to exact revenge.\n乔纳森·威克，简称约翰·威克，出生名贾达尼·乔沃诺维奇（Джарданы Джовонович），是《疾速追杀》系列电影的主角。 在自己漫长而血腥的江湖生涯中，约翰·威克成为了全世界最高效、最老练的职业杀手，赢得了广泛的声誉。 他辉煌的战绩、令人敬畏的专业技能、从不失手的精准、毫不动摇的专注和不完成任务誓不罢休的决心都让他立于不败之地，也让他在国际地下犯罪世界中的传奇地位牢不可催。 他也赢得了 Baba Yaga 或 The Boogeyman 的赫赫威名，令许多人闻风丧胆、又敬又怕。 他之前一直在为纽约的俄罗斯黑帮塔拉索夫帮效力。 为了陪伴自己的妻子海伦·威克，他决定退休。\n偷车的混混（阿尔菲·艾伦 Alfie Allen 饰）是黑帮大佬维格•塔拉索夫（迈克尔·恩奎斯特 Michael Nyqvist 饰）的儿子，而维格在听说这件事后显得紧张非常，因为约翰有着令人胆战心惊的身份。 他曾是名震江湖的冷血杀手，当年替塔拉索夫杀掉不少难缠的对手，后来却为了妻子金盆洗手。 好看！ 全程无尿点。 熊孩子坑爹的故事，这部电影告诉我们——子女教育太重要了，至少要知道什么人不能惹。 拍得很二次元，基努里维斯大叔帅到没边，拳拳到肉的感觉看着很过瘾。 被影评骗了 我觉得动作并不是很出彩 看得出来很多动作像是自己完成的 所以才觉得看上去有点笨笨呆呆慢慢的... 算比较紧凑的复仇片 但没有什么记忆深刻的地方 看完觉得wick这个人物也不过是主角光环~ 基努里维斯终于帅回来了。'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'John Wick is the main character in the "John Wick" film series, portrayed by Keanu Reeves. He is a highly skilled and efficient hitman who, after the death of his beloved dog, embarks on a path of revenge against those who wronged him. The character is known for his precision, focus, and determination in completing tasks, earning him the nickname "Baba Yaga" or "The Boogeyman" in the criminal underworld. The films showcase his journey through the world of assassins and his quest for vengeance, making him a legendary figure in the series.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what's the time and weather of Beijing"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'get_time:0', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_time'}, 'type': 'function'}, {'id': 'get_weather:1', 'function': {'arguments': '', 'name': 'get_weather'}, 'type': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_time:0', 'name': 'get_time', 'content': '2025-03-14 23:43:52.202364'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'get_weather:1', 'name': 'get_weather', 'content': '[{"FeelsLikeC": "5", "FeelsLikeF": "41", "cloudcover": "0", "humidity": "36", "localObsDateTime": "2025-03-14 11:00 PM", "observation_time": "03:00 PM", "precipInches": "0.0", "precipMM": "0.0", "pressure": "1032", "pressureInches": "30", "temp_C": "7", "temp_F": "45", "uvIndex": "0", "visibility": "10", "visibilityMiles": "6", "weatherCode": "113", "weatherDesc": [{"value": "Clear"}], "weatherIconUrl": [{"value": ""}], "winddir16Point": "SE", "winddirDegree": "140", "windspeedKmph": "9", "windspeedMiles": "6"}]'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The current time in Beijing is 23:43:52 on March 1